# Documented exceptions — pip's VENDORED copies in pip/_vendor (msgpack 1.1.2,
# and pkg_resources taken from setuptools 70.3.0), surfaced by the
# bom.cdx.json manifest pip ships since 26.2. Neither is importable by
# application code; msgpack runs only inside pip's own HTTP-cache machinery,
# and the setuptools finding (CVE in PackageIndex) targets code pip does not
# vendor at all. The REAL distributions are installed at fixed versions and
# floored in docker/Dockerfile (msgpack>=1.2.1, setuptools>=78.1.1).
#
# GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964: remove when a pip release re-vendors msgpack >=1.2.1
# (already bumped on pip's main branch).
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
